Perfect. Here's the exact CSS extracted from both components:

## glass-skeleton.tsx

**Base Classes (raw CSS equivalent):**
```css
.relative {
  position: relative;
}

.overflow-hidden {
  overflow: hidden;
}

.bg-white/5 {
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}

.backdrop-blur-sm {
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
}

.before:absolute {
  position: absolute;
}

.before:inset-0 {
  inset: 0;
}

.before:bg-gradient-to-r {
  background-image: linear-gradient(to right, ...);
}

.before:from-transparent {
  --tw-gradient-from: transparent;
}

.before:via-white/10 {
  --tw-gradient-via: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

.before:to-transparent {
  --tw-gradient-to: transparent;
}

.before:animate-[shimmer_2s_infinite] {
  animation: shimmer 2s infinite;
}
```

**Animation (Framer Motion):**
```javascript
animate={{
  backgroundPosition: ["200% 0", "-200% 0"],
}}
transition={{
  duration: 2,
  repeat: Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY,
  ease: "linear",
  delay: index * 0.1 (for text lines),
}}
```

**Inline Styles:**
```javascript
{
  backgroundSize: "400% 100%",
  width: (dynamic prop or "75%" for last text line),
  height: (dynamic prop),
}
```

**Variant Border-Radius:**
- default: `rounded-xl` (border-radius: 0.75rem)
- circular: `rounded-full` (border-radius: 9999px)
- text: `rounded-md` (border-radius: 0.375rem) + `h-4` (height: 1rem)
- card: `rounded-2xl` (border-radius: 1rem) + `min-h-[120px]` (min-height: 120px)

---

## glass-badge.tsx

**Base Classes (raw CSS equivalent):**
```css
.inline-flex {
  display: inline-flex;
}

.items-center {
  align-items: center;
}

.rounded-full {
  border-radius: 9999px;
}

.px-3 {
  padding-left: 0.75rem;
  padding-right: 0.75rem;
}

.py-1 {
  padding-top: 0.25rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
}

.text-xs {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1rem;
}

.font-medium {
  font-weight: 500;
}

.backdrop-blur-xl {
  backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
}

.border {
  border-width: 1px;
}

.transition-all {
  transition-property: all;
}

.duration-300 {
  transition-duration: 300ms;
}
```

**Variant Styles:**

| Variant | Background | Border | Text Color |
|---------|------------|--------|-----------|
| default | `bg-white/15` (rgba(255,255,255,0.15)) | `border-white/25` (rgba(255,255,255,0.25)) | `text-white` |
| primary | `bg-linear-to-r from-cyan-500/30 to-blue-500/30` (gradient) | `border-cyan-400/30` (rgba(34,211,238,0.3)) | `text-cyan-100` (rgb(206,250,254)) |
| success | `bg-emerald-500/20` (rgba(16,185,129,0.2)) | `border-emerald-400/30` (rgba(52,211,153,0.3)) | `text-emerald-100` (rgb(209,250,229)) |
| warning | `bg-amber-500/20` (rgba(245,158,11,0.2)) | `border-amber-400/30` (rgba(251,191,36,0.3)) | `text-amber-100` (rgb(254,243,199)) |
| destructive | `bg-red-500/20` (rgba(239,68,68,0.2)) | `border-red-400/30` (rgba(248,113,113,0.3)) | `text-red-100` (rgb(254,226,226)) |
| outline | `bg-transparent` | `border-white/30` (rgba(255,255,255,0.3)) | `text-white/80` (rgba(255,255,255,0.8)) |

**Size Variants:**
- sm: `px-2 py-0.5 text-xs`
- md: `px-3 py-1 text-sm`
- lg: `px-4 py-2 text-base`
